          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4-gon you placed meets other placed copies exactly at vertices. Now see how 4 copies of SOME are made automatically in the gaps! Carefully place four more copies of SOME in these gaps. Continuing this process with more copies of SOME will give us the desired tiling."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
